      "sourceTextSha256": "659a6df9e040c66d340bf81352b880a737916d36e5a1a0647033aa7c2359ecd9",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Uyuni airport for your flight to La Paz (the capital of Bolivia). Upon arrival, you will be met by a driver and transferred to your hotel.\n\nYou will enjoy a city tour including a visit to the Witches' Market and historical landmarks (4 hours). Afterward, you will tour the Valley of the Moon—a unique place near La Paz that resembles lunar landscapes due to its unusual salt, sand, and rock formations created over thousands of years by water and wind erosion.",
